        <template id="page_our_club_short_skip_view" name="Short Skip Newsletter">
            <t t-call="website.layout">
                <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure">
                    <section class="pt32 pb16">
                        <div class="container">
                            <h1>Short Skip Newsletter</h1>
                            <p>The Short Skip is SCRA's monthly newsletter. The old site
                            carried an archive of issues back to 2019, each as a downloadable
                            PDF (roughly a dozen a year, some marked with revision indicators
                            like R, R1, R2 for corrected reissues).</p>
                            <p><em>The newsletter PDFs themselves were not carried over in this
                            import - only this description. Re-uploading the archive as Odoo
                            attachments (or linking out to
                            <a href="http://www.winepi.com">winepi.com</a>, where archivist
                            Mike AD6YB maintains earlier issues) is a good follow-up task.</em></p>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </t>
